                                                "sense_id": "a5673bc7-bfae-301e-a08f-b7f2b5b34588",
                                                "text": "The most striking example is a family of small fish living in tropical American waters called the Poeciliidae among whom guppies, mosquito fish and the four-eyed anableps are best known."
